  "adequacy_argument": {
    "observed_result_adequate_to_localize_v5_response": "The two immutable candidates share seed, thresholds, duration, initializer, initial state, support-handoff physical fields, and all 600 raise-body target-position rows. Their first physical divergence is semantic step 40, the first application governed by the changed 8 versus 22 rad/s ceiling.",
